Source: pldebugger
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/EnterpriseDB/pldebugger

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pldebugger
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Server-side debugger for PL/pgSQL
 The PL/pgSQL debugger API supports debugging functions with clients such as pgAdmin.
